Welcome to lorraineklee.com. This Payment Policy outlines the payment processes and policies when you make a purchase on our website. By accessing the site and making any purchases, you agree to this Payment Policy, our Terms of Service, and our Privacy Policy.

## Payment Methods

lorraineklee.com accepts the following payment methods:

- Credit Cards: Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover

We do not accept personal checks, money orders, direct bank transfers, or cash on delivery.

## Payment Processing

All payments made on lorraineklee.com are processed securely. We employ a variety of security measures to ensure that your personal and payment information is protected.

Please note that by submitting your payment, you authorize lorraineklee.com to charge the designated account for the total amount of the purchase.

## Prices and Taxes

All prices listed on our website are in US dollars, and payment must be made in the currency as indicated on the invoice.

Prices for our products and services are subject to change without notice. lorraineklee.com reserves the right to adjust the pricing for products or services offered through the website at any time.

Applicable sales tax is added to the sales price of purchases.

## Order Confirmation

After your payment is submitted, you will receive an order confirmation via email to the email address you provided at checkout. If you do not receive an order confirmation email from us, please check your spam folder or contact us for confirmation.

## Subscription Services

If you are purchasing a subscription service from lorraineklee.com, you will be billed in advance on a recurring, periodic basis (e.g., monthly, quarterly, or annually), as specified at the time of purchase. Your subscription will automatically renew at the end of each billing cycle until you cancel it. You can cancel your subscription service at any time from your account settings or by contacting customer service.

## Refunds and Cancellations

Once purchased, we do not offer refunds or cancellations. All purchases are final.

Your payment and personal information are always safe. Our Secure Sockets Layer (SSL) software is the industry standard and among the best software available today for secure commerce transactions. It encrypts all of your personal information, including credit card number, name, and address, so that it cannot be read over the internet.

## Contact

If you have any questions about our Payment Policy, please contact us at:

contact@lorraineklee.com
